category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libprotobuf32 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Tools related to PBF (an alternative to XML format) (runtime)"
ldesc: "Osmpbf is a Java/C library to read and write OpenStreetMap PBF files. PBF
(Protocol buffer Binary Format) is a binary file format for OpenStreetMap data
that uses Google Protocol Buffers as low-level storage."
external-source: osmpbf

